            "text": "{\"page\":1,\"results\":[{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/nr5smF4avc77lhWHNcGLF7guXv1.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27,9648],\"id\":465086,\"title\":\"The Grudge\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Grudge\",\"overview\":\"After a young mother murders her family in her own house, a detective attempts to investigate the mysterious case, only to discover that the house is cursed by a vengeful ghost. Now targeted by the demonic spirits, the detective must do anything to protect herself and her family from harm.\",\"popularity\":11.3172,\"poster_path\":\"/vN7JHlHOT9rHNDU27tfYqhABBj5.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2019-12-31\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.4,\"vote_count\":1353},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/mpUPiSXk8cQsDUk3AygUxFqedjN.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27],\"id\":16126,\"title\":\"Flight of the Living Dead\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Flight of the Living Dead\",\"overview\":\"On a flight from Los Angeles to Paris, a mad scientist on the run from the CIA is transporting a coffin containing the body of a colleague infected with a genetically modified virus. While the 747 crosses a violent thunderstorm, the instability of the aircraft allows the corpse to get out of its container.\",\"popularity\":3.0308,\"poster_path\":\"/ulLuFAX6MK8QRMrhJWPJ1G9qeVH.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2007-04-06\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.0,\"vote_count\":157},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/8NMMoryipxsI2E4EL938Qi3Za8i.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27],\"id\":1602533,\"title\":\"Conte Cruel 4 - Un samedi au stade\",\"original_language\":\"fr\",\"original_title\":\"Conte Cruel 4 - Un samedi au stade\",\"overview\":\"\",\"popularity\":1.2289,\"poster_path\":\"/cl3ovlrKLIAAM0hL0DxB8rGnLPV.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2025-12-20\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":0.0,\"vote_count\":0},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[35,27],\"id\":279764,\"title\":\"The Resurrection Game\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"The Resurrection Game\",\"overview\":\"In a world where the dead walk and get in the way, a private detective teams up with a scientist and a pair of colorful zombie exterminators to uncover a global conspiracy so dark and far-reaching that zombies are the least of the problems. Stars Amy Lynn Best and Ray Yeo, with special appearances by Jasi Cotton Lanier and Debbie Rochon.\",\"popularity\":1.0318,\"poster_path\":\"/7um4deKukPeOJ9OVxhCs9wuUUR4.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2001-01-01\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":3.5,\"vote_count\":4},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/40uUPHbDMqg9zrXUjZBVwcZrtmn.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27],\"id\":1031833,\"title\":\"Shifted\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Shifted\",\"overview\":\"Strange murderous creatures roam the streets. A group of neighbours are trapped inside a house. Leaving means certain death. How are they going to survive when someone inside the house starts killing the others? Trapped between a monster inside and monsters outside. Who is going to save you when the world has Shifted?\",\"popularity\":1.5931,\"poster_path\":\"/vOTsbQBzjV2Qubxi5Lvgs21TZI4.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2022-08-21\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":4.6,\"vote_count\":5},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/4CKWB9SHod2ezNaNlw2jnb9ZNnB.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27,35],\"id\":465177,\"title\":\"Berserkers\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Meltdown\",\"overview\":\"The film follows Zeke (Robert McMurray), Callie (Alicia Marie Marcucci), Les (Seth Gontkovic) and Hunter (Jake Mulliken) on the eve of Hunter's 29th birthday as they share in a few drinks on a seemingly dull day in their hometown of Somerset. The day takes a turn for the worse as everyone they have ever known are suddenly transformed into aggressively murderous flesh eating freaks. The four comrades are forced to hack and slash their way through the reanimated corpses of their closest friends and loved ones, only to find themselves on the precipice of a post apocalyptic wasteland littered with monsters and the looming threat of their fellow survivors.\",\"popularity\":1.2731,\"poster_path\":\"/xRtyCI1AcI2igXC0rX2pzm0j1b5.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2014-08-16\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":3.3,\"vote_count\":3},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/itW5kKcm3B8F2iZEQGe0XU8ZHSA.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[28,12,27],\"id\":30644,\"title\":\"Raw Force\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Raw Force\",\"overview\":\"A group of martial arts students are en route to an island that supposedly is home to the ghosts of martial artists who have lost their honor. A Hitler lookalike and his gang are running a female slavery operation on the island as well. Soon, the two groups meet and all sorts of crazy things happen which include cannibal monks, piranhas, zombies, and more!\",\"popularity\":2.1259,\"poster_path\":\"/tREHKq24p5vpMcOUy17Mbch70uv.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1982-07-01\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.4,\"vote_count\":57},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/oAcOzQxU3jOXSKfuGFfMeO0IjmN.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27,9648,53],\"id\":30689,\"title\":\"Four Flies on Grey Velvet\",\"original_language\":\"it\",\"original_title\":\"4 mosche di velluto grigio\",\"overview\":\"Roberto, a drummer in a rock band, keeps receiving weird phone calls and being followed by a mysterious man. One night he manages to catch up with his persecutor and tries to get him to talk but in the ensuing struggle he accidentally stabs him. He runs away, but he understands his troubles have just begun when the following day he receives an envelope with photos of him killing the man. Someone is killing all his friends and trying to frame him for the murders.\",\"popularity\":3.1517,\"poster_path\":\"/dLwvOsuZ2pklMZQOGMWe6O2i7Gw.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1971-12-17\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":6.5,\"vote_count\":442},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/3yUQCRIaQFra3kY8dcK6pgDallG.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[18,27,878],\"id\":30377,\"title\":\"Zombie Death House\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Zombie Death House\",\"overview\":\"A renegade federal agent uses a new drug to create an army of unbeatable warriors.\",\"popularity\":1.5729,\"poster_path\":\"/z6QEnt5ZKz3pzjpI3GgR9oQ4W40.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1988-12-01\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":4.313,\"vote_count\":24},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[35,27],\"id\":30384,\"title\":\"Zombies Anonymous: Last Rites of the Dead\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Zombies Anonymous: Last Rites of the Dead\",\"overview\":\"In an imagined reality where zombies coexist with ordinary mortal folk, the undead are considered second-class citizens. Angela finds this out the hard way when she's shot by her boyfriend and must learn to adjust to her new zombie lifestyle. She tempers her hunger for human flesh with Zombies Anonymous meetings and tries to pass for living in the mortal world.\",\"popularity\":1.4945,\"poster_path\":\"/gGclO9cdUdtxWagP7yMu8nOez6e.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2006-10-21\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":4.5,\"vote_count\":22},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[878,10749,27,18,28],\"id\":1614193,\"title\":\"Au-delà des liens\",\"original_language\":\"fr\",\"original_title\":\"Au-delà des liens\",\"overview\":\"\",\"popularity\":0.9085,\"poster_path\":\"/echDt7UgX7eoEisS1bEIZdnk7MI.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2026-01-11\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":true,\"vote_average\":5.0,\"vote_count\":2},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/zPTBVAUWrCgIUQDV3BjoWJsdZyP.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[35,27],\"id\":30183,\"title\":\"Zombies on Broadway\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Zombies on Broadway\",\"overview\":\"Two bumbling press agents must search for a zombie to fulfill a commitment to their ex-gangster boss's new nightclub or face the consequences.\",\"popularity\":1.3477,\"poster_path\":\"/4l2bYIwRDfe9gfT7yVoowXP8koY.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1945-05-01\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.1,\"vote_count\":27},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/9MPCVBgyPkcWDw91mOfVQjygPGx.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[16,9648,878],\"id\":479248,\"title\":\"ChäoS;Child: Silent Sky\",\"original_language\":\"ja\",\"original_title\":\"CHAOS;CHILD SILENT SKY\",\"overview\":\"Silent Sky is a movie that combines the Special episodes 13 and 14. It consists of the story in the future, three months after the incident that was similar to \\\"New Generation Madness\\\" and the disease Chaos Child Syndrome that brought by the past earthquake in Shibuya.\",\"popularity\":1.6236,\"poster_path\":\"/mf8M4r8Xipe2BIraIEZnnsU2i09.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2017-06-17\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.0,\"vote_count\":7},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[27],\"id\":292720,\"title\":\"Deadville\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Deadville\",\"overview\":\"A horror film about a man who travels into the heart of a post epidemic city to get help when his girlfriend gets infected.\",\"popularity\":0.8004,\"poster_path\":null,\"release_date\":\"2010-05-01\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.0,\"vote_count\":1},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/bhk57ogiqAa3sQcoJFfTDCjZfXf.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27,53,9648],\"id\":30402,\"title\":\"Intermedio\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Intermedio\",\"overview\":\"Under the border leading into Mexico, within a labyrinth of caves, a deadly presence haunts all who enter. For four friends on an expedition, the caverns become an underground graveyard as the tortured ghosts prey upon them, one by one.\",\"popularity\":1.4817,\"poster_path\":\"/Aqav7keW6hT7E1uLBwkvZcOiZ2V.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2005-03-29\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":4.6,\"vote_count\":47},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[27,28],\"id\":30510,\"title\":\"As Night Falls\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"As Night Falls\",\"overview\":\"10 year old Amelia's parents think it's time for her to go to sleep permanently,..... leaving her broken body in a silent shallow grave. 50 years later, Mommy and Daddy are back from hell, intent on wreaking the same deadly discipline on anyone not in bed by nightfall\",\"popularity\":1.4481,\"poster_path\":\"/7XjwnIuZgVG85TcMcVLdRESfoqy.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2010-09-09\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":4.6,\"vote_count\":10},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/AlbdEwrXZSmndBSqFGfJzhmAm0q.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27,14],\"id\":30559,\"title\":\"Night of Death!\",\"original_language\":\"fr\",\"original_title\":\"La Nuit de la mort\",\"overview\":\"When she takes up her new post at an eerie convalescent home deep in the French countryside, nurse Martine soon discovers that several missing co-workers may have fallen prey to an unspeakable evil rumored to roam the hallways at night. But as Martine looks deeper into the mystery, she suspects the home's aged residents know more about the menace than they let on.\",\"popularity\":1.5996,\"poster_path\":\"/lQEX4rzZItSK67tGb7z8u6rmFEA.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1980-10-22\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.6,\"vote_count\":34},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/jGPlrwWR1lR6tKJxKUyPkPynLdy.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27],\"id\":30568,\"title\":\"The Hanging Woman\",\"original_language\":\"es\",\"original_title\":\"La orgía de los muertos\",\"overview\":\"Upon his uncle's death, Serge Chekov journeys to a spooky Scottish village for the reading of the will. But when he inherits the estate, Serge runs afoul of his uncle's jealous wife, his business partner, his maid, and others. It's not long before zombies join the fray…\",\"popularity\":2.2465,\"poster_path\":\"/q89uIp4OL3ullAplUZE3JY4hIBK.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"1973-09-03\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.5,\"vote_count\":24},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":\"/zf6n8ElECEn50Rkh6YDaOJK9qjS.jpg\",\"genre_ids\":[27],\"id\":30579,\"title\":\"Hallowed Ground\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Hallowed Ground\",\"overview\":\"After she becomes stranded in a small town, a young woman discovers her arrival there was foretold a century earlier by the town's founding preacher and that she is an integral part of his impending - and terrifying - rebirth.\",\"popularity\":1.8108,\"poster_path\":\"/5yLHghnybsyrofVwHzQdXxiWx4J.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2007-10-09\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":5.1,\"vote_count\":40},{\"adult\":false,\"backdrop_path\":null,\"genre_ids\":[27],\"id\":845157,\"title\":\"Soft Teeth\",\"original_language\":\"en\",\"original_title\":\"Soft Teeth\",\"overview\":\"A man with throbbing mouth pain suffers the consequences of ignoring the world around him.\",\"popularity\":1.075,\"poster_path\":\"/pP5TwwlVESTd2BzKPSupS5ZZLEQ.jpg\",\"release_date\":\"2022-07-01\",\"softcore\":false,\"video\":false,\"vote_average\":10.0,\"vote_count\":1}],\"total_pages\":1001,\"total_results\":20001}"
